{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "root": {
    "type": "Grid",
    "props": {
      "columns": 12,
      "gap": 16
    },
    "children": [
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "summary",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "variant": "hero"
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "summary"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "KPIStrip",
            "id": "summary_kpistrip",
            "props": {
              "items": [
                {
                  "label": "Fonts",
                  "field": "fonts",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Uses with a font name",
                  "field": "named_uses",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "font_usage_objects",
                      "search": "{{_carry_search}}",
                      "file": "{{_carry_file}}",
                      "theme": "{{_carry_theme}}",
                      "size": "{{_carry_size}}"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Layouts with a font name",
                  "field": "named_layouts",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "font_usage_layouts",
                      "search": "{{_carry_search}}",
                      "file": "{{_carry_file}}",
                      "theme": "{{_carry_theme}}",
                      "size": "{{_carry_size}}"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Files with a font name",
                  "field": "named_files",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Objects without a named font",
                  "field": "default_objects",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "font_usage_layouts",
                      "source": "default",
                      "search": "{{_carry_search}}",
                      "file": "{{_carry_file}}",
                      "theme": "{{_carry_theme}}",
                      "size": "{{_carry_size}}"
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "filter_card",
        "props": {
          "span": 12
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Row",
            "id": "filter_row",
            "props": {
              "gap": 12,
              "align": "center"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextInput",
                "id": "search_input",
                "props": {
                  "param": "search",
                  "placeholder": "Search font, layout, object or field…",
                  "width": 30
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "Select",
                "id": "file_select",
                "data": {
                  "dataset": "file_options"
                },
                "props": {
                  "param": "file",
                  "label": "File",
                  "emptyOptionLabel": "All files",
                  "multiple": true
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "Select",
                "id": "theme_select",
                "data": {
                  "dataset": "theme_options"
                },
                "props": {
                  "param": "theme",
                  "label": "Theme",
                  "emptyOptionLabel": "All themes",
                  "multiple": true,
                  "separator": "|"
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "Select",
                "id": "size_select",
                "data": {
                  "dataset": "size_options"
                },
                "props": {
                  "param": "size",
                  "label": "Size",
                  "emptyOptionLabel": "All sizes",
                  "multiple": true,
                  "separator": "|"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "fonts_card",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Fonts",
          "keepChildrenOnEmpty": true
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "fonts"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Table",
            "id": "fonts_table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "_font",
              "density": "compact",
              "sortable": true,
              "searchable": false,
              "columns": [
                {
                  "field": "font",
                  "label": "Font",
                  "valueLabels": {
                    "#default": "File default (font not in the export)"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "field": "uses",
                  "label": "Uses",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "field": "objects",
                  "label": "Objects",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "field": "layouts",
                  "label": "Layouts",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "field": "files",
                  "label": "Files",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "field": "sizes",
                  "label": "Sizes",
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "local_uses",
                  "label": "Set locally",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "count"
                },
                {
                  "field": "style_uses",
                  "label": "From a style",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "count"
                },
                {
                  "field": "theme_uses",
                  "label": "From the theme",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "count"
                },
                {
                  "field": "run_uses",
                  "label": "Rich text and charts",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "count"
                }
              ],
              "onRowClick": {
                "action": "openDashboard",
                "args": {
                  "id": "font_usage_layouts",
                  "font": "{{_font}}",
                  "source": "{{_source}}",
                  "search": "{{_carry_search}}",
                  "file": "{{_carry_file}}",
                  "theme": "{{_carry_theme}}",
                  "size": "{{_carry_size}}"
                }
              },
              "empty": {
                "message": "No font use in this selection."
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "notes_card",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Where a font comes from",
          "collapsible": true
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Markdown",
            "id": "notes_md",
            "props": {
              "content": "**Source of the base font.** FileMaker takes the first value that is set:\n- *local* — set on the object itself.\n- *local, same as inherited* — set on the object, but the same font it would get anyway. FileMaker writes it when *bold* is applied to a font with its own bold face; it is no deliberate choice.\n- *style* — the style applied to the object. A style holds only what it changes; everything else comes from the theme.\n- *theme* — the theme's default for the object type, for the layout part or for all fields.\n- *file default* — the theme names no font at all (Classic, Minimalist). FileMaker then uses a default of the file, which the XML export does not contain — the same theme shows Helvetica Neue in one file and Arial in another. The list therefore names no font for these objects; check one object per file in FileMaker.\n\n**Further font uses.** *Rich text* is a part of a text formatted with the text cursor; it adds to the base font of the object, the rest of the text keeps it. *Chart* is the font of a chart text area (title, legend, axes, data labels); series titles are left out, they keep the theme font.\n\n**Counting.** *Fonts* groups spellings of one font (`arial`, `Arial`). The file default is no font: it counts in neither the number of fonts nor *many fonts*. *Uncertain*: the value comes from a layout-part rule (rank not verified), or the applied style no longer exists in the theme.\n\n**Limits.** Fonts of conditional formatting are not listed. A font name says nothing about whether the font is installed on the clients."
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
